<p>We’ll create <code>PhoneButton.svelte</code>, a wrapper for the phone number that provides a trigger button.
There are three key parts: <strong>Script</strong>, <strong>HTML</strong>, and <strong>CSS</strong>.</p>
<h3 id="the-script-part-1">The Script Part</h3>
