// Props
let &#123; editor, box &#125;: FreComponentProps&lt;NumberWrapperBox&gt; = $props();</code></pre>
<p>Define functions to keep the component in sync when the AST or box model changes.<br>
<code>setFocus</code> forwards focus to the wrapped box; <code>refresh</code> updates any model-driven view state.</p>
<pre class="language-ts"><code class="language-ts">// CourseSchedule/phase3/src/external/PhoneButton.svelte#L16-L21

